WEBVTT

00:00:00.370 --> 00:00:02.587 line:86%
Ever imagined creating a 360

00:00:02.627 --> 00:00:04.807 line:86%
image in seconds and sending

00:00:04.847 --> 00:00:05.730 line:86%
it straight

00:00:05.770 --> 00:00:07.214 line:86%
to your client's WhatsApp?

00:00:07.370 --> 00:00:09.286 line:86%
In Vizai Render that's possible,

00:00:09.326 --> 00:00:10.670 line:86%
and I'll show you how.

00:00:11.230 --> 00:00:12.975 line:86%
Just go to the 360 tab and,

00:00:13.015 --> 00:00:14.165 line:86%
in the first step,

00:00:14.205 --> 00:00:15.990 line:86%
select a wall of your room.

00:00:16.390 --> 00:00:18.034 line:86%
Then choose where you want

00:00:18.074 --> 00:00:20.290 line:86%
the viewer to stand in the scene.

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:21.889 line:86%
Then just wait a few seconds

00:00:21.929 --> 00:00:24.066 line:86%
and a preview shows up on your screen.

00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:25.999 line:86%
This preview is for you to check

00:00:26.039 --> 00:00:27.396 line:86%
that everything is right,

00:00:27.436 --> 00:00:28.314 line:86%
and then generate

00:00:28.354 --> 00:00:29.470 line:86%
the final render.

00:01:10.300 --> 00:01:11.963 line:86%
Once the image is ready you can

00:01:12.003 --> 00:01:13.081 line:86%
copy the link or send

00:01:13.121 --> 00:01:13.847 line:86%
it straight to

00:01:13.887 --> 00:01:15.240 line:86%
your client's WhatsApp.

00:01:15.280 --> 00:01:16.624 line:86%
That way they can view

00:01:16.664 --> 00:01:18.760 line:86%
the result right on their phone.

